(:Reviewer)-[:FOLLOWS]->(:Reviewer)
(:Reviewer)-[:REVIEWS]->(:Movie)

Direct or one intermediary:

MATCH (r1:Reviewer)-[:FOLLOWS]->(r2:Reviewer)
